<!DOCTYPE html>
<html xmlns:th="http://www.thymeleaf.org">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Booking Confirmation</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h2>Booking Confirmation</h2>
    <p>Hi <b th:text="${userName}">User Name</b>,</p>
    <p>Your booking for <b th:text="${serviceName}">Service Name</b> has been confirmed.</p>
    <p>
        <b>Date:</b> <span th:text="${date}">2025-09-22</span><br>
        <b>Time:</b> <span th:text="${startTime}">10:00</span> to <span th:text="${endTime}">11:00</span><br>
        <b>Price:</b> $<span th:text="${price}">100</span>
    </p>
    <p>Thank you for using our service!</p>
</body>
</html>
